## The Operating Space {#operating-space}

MOLONARI is not one repository but an Operating Space: a set of repositories mounted side by side and kept in step by ComplexGitSync, all on the `{{ branch }}` branch. The file `.config/molonari.cgs` of MOLONARI1D lists them; recomposing the space takes pixi and Git only.

